  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aiming to protect and promote the rights of older people in Bolivia, with a special focus on poor, older women and men in rural areas. The overarching objective is to contribute to the reduction of poverty of one of the most vulnerable groups in the country, through promotion of rights and civic participation in what in the proposal is called &quot;inclusive development&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
